@description Clean & Flat Acid by Tim Techlor
@version 1.0.2
@author Tim Techlor
@metapackage
@provides
  [theme] Clean & Flat Acid by Tim Techlor.ReaperThemeZip
  [theme] Clean & Flat Acid by Tim Techlor note colors (colorblind).png
  [script main] Tim Techlor_theme_adjuster.lua
  [script] TT_ThemeAdjuster.lua
  [script main] TT_ThemeAdjuster_Apply.lua
  [script] TT_Logo_T.png
  [data] toolbar_icons/tt_*.png
  [data] toolbar_icons/150/tt_*.png
  [data] toolbar_icons/200/tt_*.png
@link Manual https://timtechlor.de/docs/clean-flat-acid-manual.html
@link Tip https://paypal.me/timtechlor
@about
  # Clean & Flat Acid
  A REAPER theme: dark graphite panels, one acid-green accent, flat square buttons.
  The theme runs on its own. The adjuster window needs ReaImGui 0.10+.
  Baking fonts, the selection frame and the logo watermark need js_ReaScriptAPI.
  The UI-scale buttons and the silent startup action need the SWS extension.
  All three are in the ReaTeam Extensions repository.
  ReaPack installs the scripts next to each other under Scripts/TimTechlor ReaScripts/Themes/.
  Load "Tim Techlor Theme Adjuster" once. After that, Options > Themes > Theme Adjuster opens it while this theme is selected.
@changelog
  1.0.2
  - FX parameters in the track panel no longer cover the pan and input rows. They, embedded FX UIs and lists placed in the bottom section now start below the input row.
  - On short tracks without room for a parameter row, the parameters stay hidden instead of being squeezed.
  1.0.1
  - The TIM TECHLOR wordmark now stays visible in the transport bar at mid widths, for example at 200 % UI scale.
  1.0.0
  - First release
